{"4745550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shell Inside", "steam_appid": 4745550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you truly want to forget? Are you sure?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every single day you step out into the world, putting on a mask. At first, it feels like salvation—a shield against a cold and unforgiving world. But year after year, it fuses with your flesh, growing heavier with every breath. You have shut yourself off from everyone for so long that you’ve locked yourself inside a cage with no key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the weight of this armor has become unbearable... you will have to take a step back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunge into the deepest corners of a fractured mind. Down where the rotting water and rusted corridors harbor everything you’ve tried to erase. To escape, you must crank the gears of your own memory and face the entity born from your deepest fears—the one who is ready to keep you in this darkness forever, just so you never have to look the truth in the eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His whisper is your fear. His walls are your defense. Who are you beneath that mask? And are you ready to face the silence when it finally falls?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you truly want to forget? Are you sure?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every single day you step out into the world, putting on a mask. At first, it feels like salvation—a shield against a cold and unforgiving world. But year after year, it fuses with your flesh, growing heavier with every breath. You have shut yourself off from everyone for so long that you’ve locked yourself inside a cage with no key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the weight of this armor has become unbearable... you will have to take a step back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunge into the deepest corners of a fractured mind. Down where the rotting water and rusted corridors harbor everything you’ve tried to erase. To escape, you must crank the gears of your own memory and face the entity born from your deepest fears—the one who is ready to keep you in this darkness forever, just so you never have to look the truth in the eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His whisper is your fear. His walls are your defense. Who are you beneath that mask? And are you ready to face the silence when it finally falls?</p>", "short_description": "Shell Inside is a psychological horror game with stylized graphics. Dive into the depths and confront your fears. Explore dark locations, search for items, and solve intricate puzzles while hiding from the terrifying ghosts of your own mind.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4745550/b434af14bb6b0503dbf8d0bbda671039aa7b8a99/header.jpg?t=1787935466", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4745550/cb13d93bd96651bb9948c9e55033e4b45a805970/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787935466", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4745550/cb13d93bd96651bb9948c9e55033e4b45a805970/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787935466", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> ОС: Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 (6GB) / AMD Radeon RX 580 / Intel Arc A380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><u